oft foods into their diet. The semisolid diet plays a crucial role in helping individuals adjust their eating habits while ensuring proper nutrition during recovery.", "NORMAL CONSISTENCY DIET:The \"NORMAL CONSISTENCY DIET\" is the final phase following bariatric surgery, designed for patients to gradually reintroduce a variety of foods into their diet. During this phase, individuals are encouraged to focus on nutritional balance while consuming easily digestible solid foods. This diet allows for a broader range of food options, supporting the transition to a more typical eating pattern while still prioritizing the health and nutritional needs of the patient.", "TRIGLYCERIDES DE CADENA MEDIA (MCT):MCTs are a type of fat that may be beneficial in the diet post-bariatric surgery due to their unique metabolic properties.", "TRIGLYCERIDES DE CADENA LARGA (LCT):LCTs are a type of fat that are more calorically dense and may be less favorable in the post-bariatric surgery diet.", "NHANES III:NHANES III is a series of studies designed to assess the health and nutritional status of adults and children in the United States.", "CARDIA:CARDIA is a long-term study that investigates the development of cardiovascular disease in young adults.", "HERITAGE FAMILY STUDY:HERITAGE Family Study is a research project that examines the role of genetics in physical fitness and health.", "GLUCOMANANO:Glucomanano is a dietary fiber supplement that is used for weight loss and cholesterol management.", "SALAS-SALVADÓ:Anna Salas-Salvadó is an esteemed author in the field of nutrition and dietetics, recognized for her significant contributions to clinical nutrition literature. She is notably a co-author of nutritional recommendations aimed at the prevention and treatment of obesity, highlighting her expertise and commitment to addressing this critical health issue.", "BARBANY:Barbany is a contributor to the consensus on the evaluation and intervention of obesity published in Rev Esp Obes.", "ARANCETA J:Aranceta J is a co-author of the guidelines for the treatment of obesity.", "BELLIDO D:Bellido D is a contributor to the clinical practice guidelines for obesity management."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}